Fix build: -Werror=sign-compare treats the loop counter's signedness
mismatch against tgt_vap_map->num_vaps (unsigned int) as an error.
This BananaPi-only block (_PLATFORM_BANANAPI_R4_) was added in
e28776520 ("2026-07-14") and is the only place in this loop nest that
uses a signed counter - the equivalent `j` loops elsewhere in the same
function already use an unsigned counter. Match that convention.

---
 source/core/services/vap_svc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/source/core/services/vap_svc.c b/source/core/services/vap_svc.c
